{"id":"84ad7d4ebd289e58","group":"72","path":"72/72-ex-mgu-not-unique-as-substitution.md","title":"最一般统一子不必字面唯一","display":"ex-mgu-not-unique-as-substitution — 最一般统一子不必字面唯一","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-ex-mgu-not-unique-as-substitution","aliases":["72-ex-mgu-not-unique-as-substitution"],"display":"ex-mgu-not-unique-as-substitution — 最一般统一子不必字面唯一","depends_on":["[[72-lem-mgu-mutual-factorization]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §2.5; complete local two-variable example","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-ex-mgu-not-unique-as-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-ex-mgu-not-unique-as-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-mgu-not-unique-as-substitution — 最一般统一子不必字面唯一"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f97e4de0d3796dd5\" href=\"?note=f97e4de0d3796dd5\" title=\"72-lem-mgu-mutual-factorization\">72-lem-mgu-mutual-factorization</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §2.5; complete local two-variable example"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in V\">\\(x,y\\in V\\)</span> 互异；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E:=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\}\">\\(E:=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta,\\eta:V\\to T\">\\(\\theta,\\eta:V\\to T\\)</span> 由下式给出，其他变量均保持不动。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta(z):=\\begin{cases}y,&amp;z=x,\\\\z,&amp;z\\ne x,\\end{cases}\\qquad\n\\eta(z):=\\begin{cases}x,&amp;z=y,\\\\z,&amp;z\\ne y.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta(z):=\\begin{cases}y,&amp;z=x,\\\\z,&amp;z\\ne x,\\end{cases}\\qquad\n\\eta(z):=\\begin{cases}x,&amp;z=y,\\\\z,&amp;z\\ne y.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MGU}(E,\\theta)\\land\\operatorname{MGU}(E,\\eta)\\land\\theta\\ne\\eta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MGU}(E,\\theta)\\land\\operatorname{MGU}(E,\\eta)\\land\\theta\\ne\\eta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\star\\eta=\\eta,\\qquad\\eta\\star\\theta=\\theta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta\\star\\eta=\\eta,\\qquad\\eta\\star\\theta=\\theta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>二者都把x与y变成同一个变量。任一统一子σ有σ(x)=σ(y)，于是θ⋆σ=σ且η⋆σ=σ，给全部变量上的因子化。θ(x)=y而η(x)=x，故不是相同代入。显示的两个复合等式逐变量计算。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-lem-mgu-mutual-factorization","status":"resolved","id":"f97e4de0d3796dd5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-mgu-mutual-factorization]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"x,y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"E:=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta,\\eta:V\\to T","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta(z):=\\begin{cases}y,&z=x,\\\\z,&z\\ne x,\\end{cases}\\qquad\n\\eta(z):=\\begin{cases}x,&z=y,\\\\z,&z\\ne y.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MGU}(E,\\theta)\\land\\operatorname{MGU}(E,\\eta)\\land\\theta\\ne\\eta.","display":true},{"tex":"\\theta\\star\\eta=\\eta,\\qquad\\eta\\star\\theta=\\theta.","display":true}],"bytes":1427,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-99","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增6项：[[72-df-logic-program-term-size]] · [[72-ex-cyclic-term-equation]] · [[72-ex-mgu-not-unique-as-substitution]] · [[72-ex-sld-success-with-infinite-branch]] · [[72-lem-mgu-mutual-factorization]] · [[72-thm-finite-term-occurs-check]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增6项：[[72-df-logic-program-term-size]] · [[72-ex-cyclic-term-equation]] · [[72-ex-mgu-not-unique-as-substitution]] · [[72-ex-sld-success-with-infinite-branch]] · [[72-lem-mgu-mutual-factorization]] · [[72-thm-finite-term-occurs-check]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增6项：[[72-df-logic-program-term-size]] · [[72-ex-cyclic-term-equation]] · [[72-ex-mgu-not-unique-as-substitution]] · [[72-ex-sld-success-with-infinite-branch]] · [[72-lem-mgu-mutual-factorization]] · [[72-thm-finite-term-occurs-check]]"}],"outgoing":["f97e4de0d3796dd5"]}